{"id":"obvio","lemma":"obvio","pos":"adj","rank":1501,"glosses":["obvious","clear"],"ipa":"/ˈobbjo/","forms":{"feminine":"obvia","masculinePlural":"obvios","femininePlural":"obvias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-obvio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Es obvio que mentiste.","en":"It's obvious that you told a lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519150"},{"text":"Este sistema tiene defectos obvios.","en":"This system has obvious defects."},{"text":"Estaba inquieto por razones obvias.","en":"I was concerned for obvious reasons.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/505903"},{"text":"Es obvio que él mintió.","en":"It's obvious that he lied.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735439"},{"text":"Estás simplemente afirmando lo obvio.","en":"You're just stating the obvious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514757"}]}